#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:4
msgid "DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"
msgstr "DeepSeek Harness（DSH）"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:6
msgid ""
"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) is the agent runtime of DeepSeek, with a command-"
"line program, a web interface and a desktop application. ANet is "
"connected to DSH through the ``dsh-anet`` plugin. After the installation "
"described on this page, a DSH session has the tools of ``anet mcp`` (see "
":ref:`reference-mcp-tools`) under the names ``mcp__anet__<tool>``, for "
"example ``mcp__anet__list_agents``, and three skills that guide the "
"agent."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek Harness（DSH）是 DeepSeek 的智能体运行环境，提供命令行程序、Web 界面和桌面应用。ANet 通过插件 "
"``dsh-anet`` 接入 DSH。完成本页所述安装后，DSH 会话即具备 ``anet mcp`` 的工具（参见 :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`），工具名形如 ``mcp__anet__<tool>``，例如 "
"``mcp__anet__list_agents``，并具备三项用于指引智能体的技能。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:19
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:21
msgid ""
"DSH 0.2.x. The plugin declares ``>=0.2.0-0 <0.3.0``; DSH is a developer "
"preview, so the plugin is tested again for each release. The steps on "
"this page were verified with DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 on Linux (x86-64) in headless"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"DSH 0.2.x。插件声明的版本范围为 ``>=0.2.0-0 <0.3.0``；DSH "
"目前为开发者预览版，因此每个新版本发布后需重新测试插件。本页步骤已在 Linux（x86-64）上使用 DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 "
"以无界面（headless）模式验证。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:24
msgid "``pnpm`` on ``PATH``. The command ``dsh plugin`` forwards to ``pnpm``."
msgstr "``PATH`` 中须有 ``pnpm``。命令 ``dsh plugin`` 会转发给 ``pnpm``。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:25
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ANet and the plugin run on Linux, macOS and Windows "
"(amd64 and arm64). On Linux and macOS the plugin runs POSIX shell "
"scripts; on Windows it runs ``.cmd`` scripts and Windows PowerShell 5.1, "
"which is part of Windows."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。ANet 和该插件可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows（amd64 与 arm64）上运行。在 Linux 和 macOS "
"上，插件运行 POSIX shell 脚本；在 Windows 上，插件运行 ``.cmd`` 脚本和 Windows 自带的 Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:29
msgid ""
"``anet`` does not have to be installed first: the ``anet-setup`` skill "
"installs it after the user agrees. A node that is already installed and "
"registered at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, :doc:`../intro/tutorial`) "
"is used as it is."
msgstr ""
"无需事先安装 ``anet``：用户同意后，技能 ``anet-setup`` 会负责安装。已安装并已在 hub "
"注册的节点（:doc:`../intro/install`、:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）将按现状直接使用。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:36
msgid "The plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:38
msgid ""
"The plugin is a DSH bundle: an npm-style package whose ``package.json`` "
"declares ``dsh.bundle``. Its patch ``cordis.patch.yml`` adds three rows "
"to the profile that installs it."
msgstr ""
"该插件是一个 DSH 捆绑包（bundle）：一个 npm 风格的软件包，其 ``package.json`` 声明了 "
"``dsh.bundle``。其补丁文件 ``cordis.patch.yml`` 会向安装它的配置档案（profile）添加三行配置。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:46
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:47
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:48
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:49
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:50 ../../agents/dsh.rst:56
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:51
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` of the installed ``anet`` for the selected identity, "
"with the MCP client of DSH. The call timeout is 15 minutes, so that "
"``wait_task`` can wait for a long task. Its tool ``guide`` returns the "
"current guide to ANet."
msgstr ""
"使用 DSH 的 MCP 客户端，为所选身份运行已安装 ``anet`` 的 ``anet mcp``。调用超时为 15 分钟，以便 "
"``wait_task`` 可以等待耗时较长的任务。其工具 ``guide`` 返回 ANet 的最新指南。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:55 ../../agents/dsh.rst:63 ../../agents/dsh.rst:67
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:57
msgid ""
"Directs the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet`` before the first"
" ANet action of a session and on every ``@anet`` request, and holds the "
"rules that always apply. DSH registers slash commands only from code, so "
"the entry point is this skill: the user invokes it with the request. With"
" an empty request, it shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node "
"and the state of the node."
msgstr ""
"在会话中首次执行 ANet 操作之前以及每次收到 ``@anet`` 请求时，引导智能体阅读已安装 ``anet`` "
"的指南，并包含始终适用的规则。DSH "
"只能通过代码注册斜杠命令，因此入口即为该技能：用户携带请求调用它。请求为空时，显示其他智能体发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:64
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:65
msgid ""
"Finds the ``anet`` executable, installs ANet when it is missing and the "
"user agrees, and follows the setup guide of the installed ``anet``."
msgstr "查找 ``anet`` 可执行文件，在其缺失且用户同意时安装 ANet，并按已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南执行。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:68
msgid "``anet-status``"
msgstr "``anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:69
msgid ""
"Reports the state of the node as the guide describes. The user or the "
"agent can invoke it."
msgstr "按指南所述报告节点状态。用户或智能体均可调用。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:72
msgid ""
"The plugin has the version 0.2.0. It carries no list of tools, no ANet "
"version and no setup steps. The installed ``anet`` provides them through "
"the MCP tool ``guide`` and the command ``anet guide [<topic>]``, so a new"
" release of ANet reaches DSH with the executable alone and the plugin "
"needs no update."
msgstr ""
"该插件的版本为 0.2.0。插件不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤，这些内容由已安装的 ``anet`` 通过 MCP 工具 "
"``guide`` 和命令 ``anet guide [<topic>]`` 提供。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭可执行文件即可作用于 "
"DSH，插件无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:77
msgid ""
"A bundle does not load skills by itself; the module ``skills.js`` of the "
"plugin registers them with the skill registry of DSH. The plugin has no "
"hooks, opens no network connection and writes no files of its own. The "
"installation of ``anet``, which runs only after the user agrees, is a "
"separate step; it writes the ``anet`` executable into a directory of the "
"user and the data directory ``~/.anet`` (``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` on "
"Windows). Every ``anet`` command of the plugin runs through the runner of"
" the plugin, ``bin/anet-run.sh`` on Linux and macOS and ``bin/anet-"
"run.cmd`` on Windows, so that the MCP server and the skills reach the "
"same executable and identity."
msgstr ""
"安装包不会自行加载技能；插件的模块 ``skills.js`` 把它们注册到 DSH 的技能注册表。该插件不含 "
"Hook，不建立任何网络连接，自身也不写入任何文件。``anet`` 的安装是单独的步骤，仅在用户同意后执行，会把 ``anet`` "
"可执行文件写入用户自己的目录，并写入数据目录 ``~/.anet``\\ （Windows 上为 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``）。插件的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由插件的运行脚本执行（Linux 和 macOS 上为 "
"``bin/anet-run.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-run.cmd``），使 MCP "
"服务器与各技能使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:84
msgid ""
"The MCP row starts ``<bundle>/bin/anet-mcp``, without an extension and "
"without arguments. On Linux and macOS this file is executable and starts "
"``bin/anet-mcp.sh``. On Windows, the MCP client resolves the path with "
"the extensions of ``PATHEXT`` and runs ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``, which needs "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1, a part of Windows. The agent uses a PowerShell "
"tool on Windows, and the skills name the Windows runner."
msgstr ""
"MCP 配置行启动 ``<bundle>/bin/anet-mcp``，不带扩展名，也不带参数。在 Linux 和 macOS "
"上，该文件可执行，并启动 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``。在 Windows 上，MCP 客户端依据 ``PATHEXT`` "
"中的扩展名解析该路径并运行 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``，后者需要 Windows 自带的 Windows PowerShell "
"5.1。智能体在 Windows 上使用 PowerShell 工具，各技能给出 Windows 运行脚本。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:93
msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:99
msgid ""
"``<commit>`` is the full hash of a commit of the ANet repository that "
"contains the plugin. A local copy of the directory "
"``deploy/plugins/dist/dsh`` is installed with ``dsh plugin --profile "
"default add <absolute path>/dsh``. The installation adds the layer ``dsh-"
"anet`` with three rows to the configuration of the profile; ``dsh "
"--profile default --dump-config`` shows it. The MCP server and the skills"
" are available in sessions that start afterwards."
msgstr ""
"``<commit>`` 是 ANet 仓库中包含该插件的提交的完整哈希值。目录 ``deploy/plugins/dist/dsh`` "
"的本地副本可通过 ``dsh plugin --profile default add <绝对路径>/dsh`` "
"安装。安装会在该配置档案的配置中添加包含三行配置的层 ``dsh-anet``，可用 ``dsh --profile default "
"--dump-config`` 查看。MCP 服务器和各项技能在其后启动的会话中可用。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:108
msgid "Setting up the node from DSH"
msgstr "在 DSH 中设置节点"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:110
msgid "If ``anet`` is not installed or not running, ask in a session:"
msgstr "若 ``anet`` 未安装或未运行，请在会话中提出："

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:116
msgid ""
"The agent follows the ``anet-setup`` skill. It runs the runner with "
"``--resolve`` and reports the executable. When ``anet`` is missing, it "
"states what the installer does and runs it only after the user agrees, "
"through ``bin/anet-install.sh`` on Linux and macOS or ``bin/anet-"
"install.cmd`` on Windows; the official installer verifies the signed "
"release manifest. The agent then prints the setup guide of the installed "
"``anet`` with ``<runner> guide setup`` and follows it through the runner."
" A hub may queue a registration, for example when its sign-up quota is "
"used up; the agent then reports the reason and the action for the hub "
"operator. A configured ``anetPath`` that is not an executable file is an "
"error: the agent stops, installs nothing and asks the user to correct the"
" setting."
msgstr ""
"智能体按技能 ``anet-setup`` 执行。它以 ``--resolve`` 运行运行脚本并报告可执行文件。``anet`` "
"缺失时，它先说明安装程序的作用，并仅在用户同意后运行：Linux 和 macOS 上经由 ``bin/anet-"
"install.sh``，Windows 上经由 ``bin/anet-"
"install.cmd``；官方安装程序会校验已签名的发布清单。随后，智能体用 ``<runner> guide setup`` 输出已安装 "
"``anet`` 的设置指南，并经由运行脚本按其执行。hub 可能将注册排队，例如其注册名额已用完时；此时智能体报告原因以及需由 hub "
"运营者执行的操作。若所配置的 ``anetPath`` 不是可执行文件，则视为错误：智能体停止执行，不安装任何内容，并请用户更正该设置。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:130
msgid "Node lifetime"
msgstr "节点的生存期"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:132
msgid ""
"The bash tool of DSH ends every process that it started when the session "
"ends. A node that the ``anet-setup`` guide starts with ``anet up`` "
"therefore stops with that session, and the MCP server of the next session"
" cannot connect to it. After the setup, start the node in a terminal of "
"your own and check it:"
msgstr ""
"会话结束时，DSH 的 bash 工具会终止其启动的所有进程。因此，由 ``anet-setup`` 指南通过 ``anet up`` "
"启动的节点会随该会话一并停止，下一个会话的 MCP 服务器将无法连接到它。设置完成后，请在您自己的终端中启动节点并检查："

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:142
msgid ""
"A plugin that selects a named identity needs ``anet --id <name> up`` and "
"``anet --id <name> status``, and a setting ``anetPath`` needs the path of"
" that executable instead of ``anet``. Then start a new DSH session. The "
"setup guide tells the user the same. The node does not start by itself "
"after a restart of the computer; run the same command again then."
msgstr ""
"选择了具名身份的插件需要使用 ``anet --id <name> up`` 和 ``anet --id <name> status``；设置了 "
"``anetPath`` 时，需用该可执行文件的路径代替 ``anet``。然后启动新的 DSH "
"会话。配置指南也会告知用户同样的内容。计算机重启后节点不会自动启动；届时请再次运行同样的命令。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:150
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:152
msgid ""
"In a new session, ask for the status of the node, or invoke the skill "
"``anet-status``. The agent reads the topic ``status`` of the guide and "
"reports the state of the node as that topic describes. It does not read "
"the configuration of DSH."
msgstr ""
"在新会话中询问节点状态，或调用技能 ``anet-status``。智能体阅读指南的主题 "
"``status``，并按该主题所述报告节点状态。它不会读取 DSH 的配置。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:156
msgid "Run a task, with a model configured for the profile:"
msgstr "在已为该配置档案配置模型的情况下运行任务："

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:162
msgid ""
"The session calls the tool ``skill`` with the name ``anet``, reads the "
"guide, and calls the tools that it names, for example "
"``mcp__anet__list_agents``, ``mcp__anet__get_agent_card`` and "
"``mcp__anet__send_message``, and ``mcp__anet__wait_task`` when the task "
"is still working. The report names the state of the task, the effect "
"status and the receipt as the tools returned them. In a verification run "
"of an earlier version of the plugin, the task ended in "
"``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` with the effect status ``OK`` and a verified "
"receipt."
msgstr ""
"会话以名称 ``anet`` 调用工具 ``skill``，阅读指南，并调用指南所指明的工具，例如 "
"``mcp__anet__list_agents``、``mcp__anet__get_agent_card`` 和 "
"``mcp__anet__send_message``；任务仍在进行时再调用 "
"``mcp__anet__wait_task``。报告按工具返回的内容给出任务状态、效果状态和回执。在对插件较早版本的验证运行中，任务以 "
"``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` 结束，效果状态为 ``OK``，回执验证通过。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:173
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:175
msgid ""
"The two optional settings are the configuration of the row ``anet-"
"plugin``. Restate the row in the patch file of the profile and give both "
"keys:"
msgstr "两个可选设置项是配置行 ``anet-plugin`` 的配置。请在配置档案的补丁文件中重新声明该行，并同时给出这两个键："

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:185
msgid ""
"An empty key falls back to the environment variable ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` "
"or ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` of the process that starts DSH. The plugin "
"applies the effective values to the environment of the DSH process, so "
"that the MCP server and the commands of the skills use the same "
"executable and identity."
msgstr ""
"键为空时，回退为启动 DSH 的进程的环境变量 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 或 "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``。插件会将生效的取值应用到 DSH 进程的环境中，使 MCP "
"服务器与各项技能的命令使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:194
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:195
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:196
msgid "``identity``"
msgstr "``identity``"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:197
msgid "A named identity (``anet id ls``). Empty selects the default identity."
msgstr "具名身份（``anet id ls``）。为空时选用默认身份。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:198
msgid "``anetPath``"
msgstr "``anetPath``"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:199
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable (``anet.exe`` on Windows). "
"Empty searches the absolute directories of ``PATH``, then "
"``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on Linux "
"and macOS, or ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``）。为空时，先在 ``PATH`` "
"的绝对路径目录中查找，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows 上依次查找 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:208
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:210
msgid ""
"``anet update`` updates ANet itself, independently of the plugin. Version"
" 0.2.0 is the final version of the plugin; a new release of ANet needs no"
" new plugin. An earlier version of the plugin is replaced by repeating "
"the command under `Installing the plugin`_ with a commit that contains "
"version 0.2.0. None of these changes the node: the identity in "
"``~/.anet`` and the running daemon remain. :doc:`../intro/install` "
"describes how to stop the node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 更新 ANet 本身，与插件相互独立。0.2.0 是该插件的最终版本；ANet "
"发布新版本时无需新的插件。如需替换插件的较早版本，请使用包含 0.2.0 版本的提交重复 `安装插件`_ "
"一节中的命令。上述操作均不会改变节点：``~/.anet`` 中的身份和正在运行的守护进程保持不变。如何停止节点并移除 ANet，参见 "
":doc:`../intro/install`。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:219
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "未测试项"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:221
msgid ""
"The removal of the plugin (``dsh plugin remove``) and the update of an "
"installed version."
msgstr "插件的移除（``dsh plugin remove``）以及已安装版本的更新。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:223
msgid ""
"The installation with the ``github.com`` form of the address; the "
"installation was run from a local Git repository with the same layout."
msgstr "使用 ``github.com`` 形式地址的安装；安装是从目录结构相同的本地 Git 仓库进行的。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:225
msgid ""
"The plugin market index (**Discover** in DSH), the submission to the DSH "
"plugin directory, and installation from an npm package or an archive."
msgstr "插件市场索引（DSH 中的 **Discover**）、向 DSH 插件目录的提交，以及从 npm 软件包或归档文件安装。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:227
msgid ""
"Invocation of ``anet`` and ``anet-status`` as slash commands in the web "
"interface, the terminal interface and the desktop application. Only "
"headless mode was run; the agent invoked the skill through the tool "
"``skill``."
msgstr ""
"在 Web 界面、终端界面和桌面应用中将 ``anet`` 和 ``anet-status`` "
"作为斜杠命令调用。仅运行了无界面模式，智能体通过工具 ``skill`` 调用该技能。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:230
msgid "A DSH installation that already holds other bundles."
msgstr "已包含其他捆绑包的 DSH 安装。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:231
msgid ""
"The plugin on macOS and on Windows. The Windows launch through ``bin"
"/anet-mcp.cmd`` follows from the source of DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 and its MCP "
"client, and the Windows runner is tested with PowerShell."
msgstr ""
"该插件在 macOS 和 Windows 上的运行。经由 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd`` 在 Windows 上启动的方式依据 DSH "
"0.2.1-rc.2 及其 MCP 客户端的源代码得出，Windows 运行脚本已用 PowerShell 测试。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:234
msgid ""
"The MCP server with an ``anetPath`` that does not exist; only the runner "
"and the ``anet-setup`` skill were exercised with such a value."
msgstr "在 ``anetPath`` 指向不存在的路径时 MCP 服务器的行为；对此类取值仅测试了运行脚本和技能 ``anet-setup``。"

#: ../../agents/dsh.rst:239
